Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.30,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:06.40,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,700,4260,5280)\pos(635.949,339.407)}Episode 35
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:06.40,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,700,4260,5280)\pos(635.949,535.71)}Self-Injury Ruse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.26,0:00:12.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Jiang Gan's message misled Cao Cao into putting \NNaval Commanders Cai Mao and Zhang Yun to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:17.96,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,while Zhuge Liang's "borrowing of arrows" \Ncaused Cao Cao to lose around 150,000 arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.47,0:00:22.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,These continuous setbacks irritated Cao Cao immensely,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:26.29,Thinking,,0,0,0,,so he accepted Xun You's ploy of a false surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:32.29,Thinking,,0,0,0,,sending Cai Mao's relatives \NCai Zhong and Cai He to Eastern Wu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.29,0:00:35.35,Thinking,,0,0,0,,as sleeper agents to spy out useful information.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.35,0:00:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Report! Chief Commander, ships from the north have reached our port!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.64,0:00:45.00,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(388.475,451.948)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2800,3180)}Zhōu Yú \NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.01,0:00:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are among them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.53,0:00:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Zhong and Cai He, along with a few hundred soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:52.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(322.121,442.596)}Lǔ Sù \NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Have they brought their families?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.85,0:00:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring them to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.06,0:01:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.14,0:01:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Take seats!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the two generals enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help us avenge our \Nelder brother, Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.67,0:01:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You two must have a lot to say. Take your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother, Cai Mao, and Marshal \NZhang Yun loyally trained Cao Cao's navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:28.56,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(951.706,467.532)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3200,3560)}Cài Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But that old bastard murdered them instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We both swore to avenge our brother, and we hope that you may keep us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.66,0:01:38.48,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(977.939,419.221)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2420,2760)}Cài Zhōng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We wish to serve in the vanguard when you attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:48.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(954.792,462.468)}Zhūgé Liàng \NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your sorrows, for I shall take revenge for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gan Ning!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.14,0:01:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.66,0:02:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Take these two generals and their troops under your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.66,0:02:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Treat them with courtesy,\N take good care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.54,0:02:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.46,0:02:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, their surrender is most likely a trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.42,0:02:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The two are here to avenge their brother. What deceit is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.98,0:02:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They came with their troops, but not their families!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This cannot be real!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, are you so suspicious that you reject the aid of able men?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.58,0:02:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.70,0:03:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I laugh at your ignorance over Gongjin's intentions!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yangtze runs between the two fighting armies,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.94,0:03:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,hence communication is difficult \Nand spies can scarcely cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao sent Cai Zhong and Cai He here to feign surrender so that they could spy on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.06,0:03:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin is utilizing their plan to pass on select intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As they say, wars are deceitful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Xingba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.74,0:03:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.30,0:03:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you make arrangements for the Cai brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Observing your expression earlier today, \NI know their surrender is false.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:56.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(930.102,445.714)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2980,3320)}Gān Níng \NStyled: Xìngbà
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have not figured out how you wish to deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep those traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them leak certain information for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:12.94,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Keep tending to them with diligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:15.34,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,but be wary over their actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can rest assured!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:03.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(392.329,326.909)}Huáng Gài\NStyled: Gōngfù
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:03.94,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,Huang Gai; I have brought provisions\N and am here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.94,0:05:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As you have come late at night, might there be something important to discuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We are outnumbered and cannot afford to prolong the war. How can we finish this soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, do you have any plans you wish to suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.22,0:05:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not attack with fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told you to suggest this tactic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.34,0:05:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No other. I thought of it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.26,0:06:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongfu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.98,0:06:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was also thinking of attacking with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hence, I pretended to accept Cai Zhong and Cai He,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so that I may feed them false intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Cao Cao is crafty and scheming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:29.58,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,If we are not thorough in our plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:32.62,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,it will be hard to attack using fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That is true. If this were on land, we could mount an ambush
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and if this were in their camps, we could burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, we are fighting on water...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:48.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How can we sail to their camp in secret \Nand set their ships ablaze?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Zhong and Cai He feigned their surrender to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:01.94,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,We also could send one of our men over to feign surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:04.78,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,setting the enemy ships ablaze \Nwhile they are unaware.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Only, this person needs to be more appealing than the Cai brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, Cao Cao will not trust them easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to go through with this plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You are willing to go through with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I will feign surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Elder general, you have fought for three generations with ferocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:50.26,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You joined the former lord in their campaign,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:52.54,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}crushing bandits in the south and Dong Zhuo in the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Your achievements are immense, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.42,0:07:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Perhaps Commander does not have faith in me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.10,0:08:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Cao Cao is a deceitful man, \Nand now we must deceive him using a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}If we do not use the "Ruse of Self-Injury," how would he believe us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.98,0:08:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Gongfu, you are of old age. Should anything go wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}how could I ever face the elders of Jiangdong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.46,0:08:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For the defeat of Cao, \Nfor the Marquis of Wu's great undertaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,even if I were to be ground to dust, I, Huang Gai, would do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, if you can go through the Self-Injury Ruse, \Nit would be a blessing for all citizens of Jiangdong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your gallant spirit deserves utter respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,May you accept my respects!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This honor is too much, too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I am honoring you on behalf of the Marquis of Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if one lives to a hundred, there is still death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to follow after the ancient heroes and be remembered greatly in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then will I die without regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention all generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I was given our liege's command to lead our troops in defeating Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Although we have defeated their army earlier at sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.74,0:09:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,in analyzing the reports of \Ntheir defecting generals Cai Zhong and Cai He,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:10:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao has a mighty army of a million, and camps stretching on for 300 {\i1}li.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are outnumbered. If we wish to defeat \NCao Cao, we cannot achieve this in one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I order each of you to collect three months' worth of provisions and prepare for an attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.02,0:10:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, our navy has already defeated the Cao army in the initial battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We should seize this momentum and swiftly crush the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,General Huang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao is resourceful and skilled in army leadership.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When Yuan Shao and Cao Cao fought at Guandu,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.34,0:10:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan Shao's troops of 100,000 were defeated by Cao Cao's tens of thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.98,0:10:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Since our forces are vastly inferior to the Cao army's,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,it would be hard to win on the offense, so defense is paramount.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.02,0:10:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We will wear down their army through a strategy of attrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:57.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(305.148,494.027)}Zhāng Zhāo \NStyled: Zǐbù
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:11:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When they are drained of supplies, \Nthey will collapse without being attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on what you say, not just three months,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but even thirteen months' worth of provisions \Nwill not ease the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.34,0:11:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As I see it, if we can beat Cao Cao this month, \Nthen we should do so!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.30,0:11:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If he cannot be taken down this month,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,why not we take Zhang Zibu's advice in \Nlaying down our arms and surrendering to the north?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Huang Gongfu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}You were the one who advocated for war,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}yet now, you are the one suggesting surrender?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Such a capricious act for a veteran of three rulers of Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.98,0:11:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Under our lord's mandate, \NI command the three divisions!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}I gave my word that whoever \Nsuggests surrender shall be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.34,0:12:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}We are in a war, yet you dare spout such nonsense, shaking the army's morale!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Without your execution, \Nhow could I command my men?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Have Huang Gai executed, then report back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:15.90,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,Ever since I followed General Sun Jian,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:18.30,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,I subjugated the southeast for three rulers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was Zhou Yu the Brat then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him away at once and behead him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu! You whelp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.98,0:12:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare execute a veteran of three rulers!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu, you whelp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:33.46,Default,Gan Ning,0,0,0,,Sir, Huang Gai has served Wu loyally for decades!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:34.94,Default,Gan Ning,0,0,0,,Please pardon him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare disrupt my command?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.50,0:12:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat Gan Ning out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It is disadvantageous to execute a \Nmajor general before a looming army!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, think over this thrice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, please show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.98,0:13:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang Gai deserves punishment, but withhold his sentence for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:05.90,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,After Cao Cao has been defeated,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.90,0:13:07.98,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,it will not be too late to execute him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.06,0:13:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, please show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.02,0:13:26.78,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,If it were not for all the generals,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:28.22,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,I would have executed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I will spare his life today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Drag him out and beat him \Na hundred times on the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, please show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, please show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to your station!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fellow generals, no need to beg, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:13:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It is only death!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:04.86,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu, you urchin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.06,0:14:26.62,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,One! Two! Three! Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:30.42,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Five! Six! Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:32.14,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Beat him harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:35.90,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Whoever shows sympathy shall suffer like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:38.14,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:43.06,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Ten! Eleven! Twelve! Thirteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:46.54,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Fourteen! Fifteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:50.26,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Sixteen! Seventeen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:51.42,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Eighteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:54.34,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Nineteen! Twenty! Twenty-One!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:14:56.70,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Twenty-Two! Twenty-Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.14,0:15:00.30,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Twenty-Four! Twenty-Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:02.22,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Twenty-Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:05.02,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Twenty-Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.54,0:15:06.70,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Twenty-Eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.94,0:15:09.02,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Twenty-Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:12.42,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Thirty-One!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.26,0:15:14.30,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Thirty-Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:18.54,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Thirty-Three! Thirty-Four! Thirty-Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:21.18,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Thirty-Six! Thirty-Seven! Thirty-Eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:23.50,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Thirty-Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.74,0:15:24.74,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Forty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:29.42,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Forty-One! Forty-Two! Forty-Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:38.82,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:41.38,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Stop the beatings!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.82,0:15:45.42,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Gongfu is old, he may not endure such injuries!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:50.42,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,If you say one more word, you will face my wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:16:00.78,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Forty-Four! Forty-Five! Forty-Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:07.18,Default,Enforcer,0,0,0,,Forty-Seven! Forty-Eight! Forty-Nine! Fifty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:09.74,Default,All,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.06,0:16:14.70,Default,All,0,0,0,,Chief Commander! Show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:20.42,Default,All,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:24.46,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.74,0:16:26.54,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Huang Gai has fainted!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.54,0:16:34.46,Default,All,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, please show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:38.10,Default,All,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, please show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.78,0:16:44.38,Default,All,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, please, please show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:48.94,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Keep the remaining fifty on hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:51.82,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,If he dares utter more nonsense,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.94,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,he shall claim the other half!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.18,0:17:02.30,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Quick, quickly lift Elder General \NHuang back to his tent, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.82,0:17:06.10,Default,All,0,0,0,,General Huang! Elder General Huang!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.38,0:17:10.62,Default,All,0,0,0,,General, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:13.10,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Huang Gongfu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:16.02,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,See if you dare belittle me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:18.58,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Gongfu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:21.82,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Gongfu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:31.18,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:34.94,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Split this medicine in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.42,0:18:39.02,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Let him drink one half and apply the other on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.02,0:18:40.46,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,It will heal his wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:51.42,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Gongfu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:53.06,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Gongfu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:54.66,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Gongfu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.42,0:18:58.62,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Drink some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:25.10,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Elder General, Elder General!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:27.78,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Please rest and recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:37.66,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Let us leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:39.34,Default,All,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:56.86,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,When Gongjin reprimanded Gongfu,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:20:00.58,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,I dared not admonish since I was a subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:02.54,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,However, you are our guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:05.94,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Why did you remain silent?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.98,0:20:12.46,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Zijing, why ask for answers you already know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:14.10,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,You wish to trick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:18.02,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Ever since I invited you across the river,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.02,0:20:19.94,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,I have never tricked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:22.54,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Why are you saying such words?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:32.54,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Are you oblivious that the thrashing of Huang Gongfu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:34.18,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}... is part of Gongjin's strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:38.18,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Had I dissuaded him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.90,0:20:41.34,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}would it not ruin Gongjin's grand plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:45.58,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Without the Self-Injury Ruse,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:47.98,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}how can we deceive Cao Cao?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:54.06,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The Commander told\N Huang Gongfu to feign surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.62,0:20:57.26,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}manipulating Cai Zhong and Cai He to report such.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:02.10,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When you see Gongjin later...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:03.62,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Sir, rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.14,0:21:06.10,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,I shall not reveal this to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:08.54,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,I will only mention...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:12.06,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,... that you were also complaining about his actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.46,0:21:14.06,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,That is very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:23.04,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Even if this was part of a plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.46,0:21:26.70,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,the punishment was too severe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.82,0:21:31.62,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Were it too light, would the Cai brothers believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.70,0:21:36.10,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}One is willing to beat; the other is willing to receive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.26,0:21:40.82,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The one willing to receive feels pain of the body;
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.82,0:21:44.66,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}the one willing to beat feels pain of the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:51.30,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With such officers in Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.82,0:21:54.82,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}why worry that Cao Cao will not be defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.78,0:22:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang, Officer Kan Ze is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite him in immediately, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.74,0:22:48.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(935.117,480.39)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3220,3580)}Kǎn Zé \NStyled: Dérùn
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.98,0:23:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,General, have you any enmity \Ntowards Chief Commander Zhou?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.74,0:23:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be the Ruse?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have received favor from the three lords. \NNothing is enough to repay them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.82,0:23:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I suggested this stratagem to defeat Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.58,0:23:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I have suffered, my heart bears no grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.42,0:24:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Only, there is no one loyal enough to entrust this hefty responsibility to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.14,0:24:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongfu, perhaps you want me to cross the river to deliver a letter of surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.30,0:24:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Of everyone in the army, \Nthere is no man able to be my confidant.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.30,0:24:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}You are the only one with both \Nthe loyalty and the gift of rhetoric.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.30,0:24:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Therefore, I dare entrust \Nmy heart's troubles to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.94,0:24:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Are you willing to take on this task?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.78,0:24:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}If you are willing to suffer severe punishment for our Marquis,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.30,0:24:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}why should I worry about my own head?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.30,0:24:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}If a man focuses on minor matters and does nothing in life,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.54,0:24:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}how is he different from rotting grass?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.66,0:24:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will leave this to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.34,0:25:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please get up, general!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.00,0:25:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have... already written the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.34,0:25:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.50,0:25:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,General, there is no time to lose! I shall cross the river tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.62,0:25:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.54,0:25:39.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.615,480.39)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3600,3920)}Cáo Cāo \NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.98,0:25:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we arrested a fisherman by the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.90,0:25:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He claims to be Kan Ze, an Adjutant of Eastern Wu, and is carrying classified information.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.58,0:25:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring him to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.90,0:25:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.94,0:26:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What is an adjutant of Eastern Wu doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.50,0:26:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,People say that Chancellor Cao earnestly seeks for able men.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.46,0:26:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking back at that, rumors remain only rumors!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.38,0:26:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang Gongfu, Huang Gongfu, you have made a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.66,0:27:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,From your choice of words, \Nyou imply that I should not question you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.86,0:27:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang is a veteran who served three marquis of Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.38,0:27:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but was viciously beaten by \NZhou Yu and nearly lost his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.06,0:27:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He entrusted me with a letter \Nsince he wishes to defect to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.82,0:27:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongfu and I are close like family, so I am here to deliver the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.06,0:27:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I just did not expect such a cold reception!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.30,0:27:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am in constant conflict with Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.50,0:27:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and you have come privately, \Nso why should I not be doubtful?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.06,0:27:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.62,0:28:02.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}I have been treated generously by the Sun clan, \Nso I should not be unfaithful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.86,0:28:07.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}However with the current situation, Zhou Yu's soldiers of Wu's six commanderies,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.06,0:28:10.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}when pitted against your army of a million, are outmatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.82,0:28:12.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}This is the consensus throughout the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.94,0:28:16.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Yet that conceited whelp Zhou Yu seeks to smash a stone with an egg;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.98,0:28:22.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}he also abuses his power, punishes the innocent, and does not reward men of glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.14,0:28:25.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Even as a veteran, I was disgraced for no reason. I truly resent him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.94,0:28:30.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}I have heard Your Excellency treats people sincerely, \Nhumbly welcoming new talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.14,0:28:33.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}I wish to surrender with my troops, \Nand earn merits to cover my shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.70,0:28:36.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}I will bring along supplies and armor as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.14,0:28:41.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}I tearfully offer you these words. \NPlease do not doubt my sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.16,0:28:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, execute him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.98,0:28:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.66,0:28:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have seen through your trick, \Nso why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.70,0:29:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am laughing at Gongfu for \Nbeing a poor judge of character!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.90,0:29:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he make a poor judgment?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.02,0:29:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to kill me, kill me. \NWhat more needs to be said?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.46,0:29:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}I know you are unconvinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.22,0:29:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Allow me to expose your little tricks, \Nso that you can die without complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.10,0:29:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Zhou Yu is a crafty man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.30,0:29:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}He ordered Huang Gai to use the Self-Injury Ruse,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.98,0:29:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}then sent you to offer me this letter of "surrender."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.98,0:29:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Were you unaware I've read military books since I was young, aware of all the arts of deception?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.26,0:29:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}This ruse of yours could only trick lesser men. \NHow could it possibly fool me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.98,0:29:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}The holes in the letter are obvious, \Na pity you are ignorant of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.90,0:29:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}and now lose your life in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.62,0:29:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Where are the falsehoods in the letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.98,0:30:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}I will point out the holes \Nand let you die without complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.74,0:30:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}If this were truly sincere about surrendering,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.50,0:30:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}why is there no offered date and time of meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.90,0:30:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Is this not a hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.32,0:30:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}To think you still claim to be learned in military affairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.44,0:30:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}The illiterate lot like you should hurry and call the war off!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.78,0:30:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}If you fight, you will surely be captured by Zhou Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.30,0:30:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}It is only a pity that I will die by \Nyour hands even after bending myself to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.30,0:30:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Why call me illiterate?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.70,0:30:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}You show no respect to the talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.50,0:31:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}What more need I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.30,0:31:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}It is but only death.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.58,0:31:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Should your words be reasonable, \Nthen you will have my admiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.90,0:31:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Chancellor, did you not hear this saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.30,0:31:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}"In betraying their liege, the date cannot be set"?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.30,0:31:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If a date was arranged \Nwithout the right opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.38,0:31:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}if you still respond, the plan will be exposed!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.42,0:31:29.06,Default,Kan Ze,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Plots of a grand scale can only happen as they come
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.06,0:31:31.58,Default,Kan Ze,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How can the time be predetermined?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.06,0:31:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}If one does not understand this logic, \Nbut instead kills a good man in error,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.26,0:31:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}are they not among the illiterate lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.38,0:31:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Sir, my lack of insight has brought offense to your dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.98,0:32:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Please do not bear ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.30,0:32:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}Chancellor, me and Huang Gongfu are surrendering wholeheartedly,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.10,0:32:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}like children longing for their parents, {\bord12.88}or wishing for rain in a drought!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.58,0:32:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}These passionate feelings are known to Heaven and Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.50,0:32:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}Very well, if you two accomplish this great deed,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.14,0:32:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}then your reward will stand above all others.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.10,0:32:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88\pos(640,666.666)}We come not for titles nor riches!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.26,0:32:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.88}We are merely following the \Nwill of Heaven and the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.54,0:32:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.58,0:33:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Bring in wine to make up to our good sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.62,0:33:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.30,0:33:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. I now understand you and General Huang's sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.78,0:33:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I would trouble you to return to Eastern Wu \Nto arrange this with General Huang.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.94,0:33:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When you make the move, send a message and I will receive you with my boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.42,0:33:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I have already left Eastern Wu, so I cannot go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.98,0:33:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to send another confidant ahead instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.62,0:33:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This matter must be classified. \NIt might leak if we send another.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.38,0:34:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.28,0:34:06.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I cannot stay for long and will cross the river now, so as to not raise Zhou Yu's suspicions!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.44,0:34:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You act decisively. It is a pity we have not met sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.94,0:34:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.62,0:34:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.42,0:34:25.70,Default,Kan Ze,0,0,0,,I am moved by the Chancellor's generous gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.66,0:34:30.42,Default,Kan Ze,0,0,0,,However, with success unrealized, I cannot accept them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.42,0:34:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It will not be too late for us to take \Nthese rewards when Gongfu and I come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.14,0:34:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.98,0:34:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kan Derun!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.66,0:34:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.86,0:34:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please provide any further instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.22,0:35:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir is not swayed by gold nor silk!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.26,0:35:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You are truly an outstanding personage from Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.38,0:35:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take my leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.18,0:35:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Derun!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.34,0:35:45.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will visit General Huang first then go to your tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.38,0:36:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Were it not for your eloquence, my plan would have been exposed by Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.90,0:36:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and I would have suffered in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.38,0:36:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The letter Cao Cao read must have been sent by Cai Zhong and Cai He.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.38,0:36:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I will visit Gan Xingba and hear more about the Cai brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.06,0:36:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.34,0:36:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Derun, why are you visiting me this late?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.02,0:37:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When you tried to plead for Gongfu yesterday, you were beaten by Zhou Yu in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.58,0:37:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was outraged.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.98,0:37:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I visited Gongfu just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.10,0:37:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you need to dress like that when visiting Gongfu?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.34,0:37:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sleeves are still wet. \NWere you fishing along the banks?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.06,0:37:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Xingba!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.90,0:37:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you just returned north of the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.70,0:37:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Xingba, please keep your voice down!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.54,0:37:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kan Ze!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.42,0:37:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You are an officer for Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.78,0:37:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you colluded with the enemy at night and are now here to try to sow discord!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.74,0:37:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Xingba, to be honest with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.26,0:37:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,it is true that I have returned from the north,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.98,0:38:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but I did not betray Eastern Wu without a reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.26,0:38:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It is only because Zhou Yu acts so brazen,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.50,0:38:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that even veterans like Gongfu nearly died under his hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.22,0:38:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You were also beaten when you pleaded for Gongfu!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.62,0:38:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel indignant for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.74,0:38:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I decided to join Chancellor Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.42,0:38:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I have been found out...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.06,0:38:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wish to kill me, then kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.38,0:38:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.78,0:38:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,With Zhou Yu being so heartless,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.50,0:38:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I also have the same intention.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.50,0:38:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.54,0:38:45.54,Default,Cai Zhong & Cai He,0,0,0,,Why don't we enter now and confront them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.26,0:38:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The audacity that both of you have!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.70,0:38:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Xingba, these two have eavesdropped on our secrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.74,0:39:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Kill them now to seal their mouths!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.22,0:39:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.58,0:39:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.90,0:39:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.98,0:39:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We were both sent here by \NChancellor Cao to feign our surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.46,0:39:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really true?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.78,0:39:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you two have the intentions to surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.70,0:39:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we can help introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.42,0:39:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.50,0:39:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Zhong, you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.14,0:39:51.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General Gan, we saw how you \Nand Huang Gongfu were humiliated.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.18,0:39:53.50,Default,Cai Zhong,0,0,0,,We've already informed Chancellor Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.54,0:40:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When a man meets a worthy master, \Nhe ought to serve wholeheartedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.30,0:40:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, come! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.02,0:40:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave General Huang's letter \Nof surrender to Chancellor Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.06,0:40:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I just came to visit Brother Xingba tonight to arrange our surrender in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.22,0:40:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.86,0:40:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not! Your surrender is sincere!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.98,0:40:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We will inform the Chancellor of this tomorrow!

